# Build context for ./Dockerfile (TASK-MUM6CYJFKW69I K-2).
# Without this file `COPY . .` carried the local .env into the image: Next's
# `output: 'standalone'` copies .env into .next/standalone, so local secrets and
# local-only switches (INNGEST_DEV=1, DEMO_LOGIN_ENABLED) shipped with it.
# Runtime configuration comes from the container environment (docker-compose.yml).

# env files: every one except the placeholder template, at ANY depth.
# `.env*` alone matches only the context root: deploy/vps/.env.prod (live secrets,
# incl. the owner password) went into the worker image through `COPY . .` (FO-250 Y-1).
**/.env*
!**/.env*.example

# installed / built on the host: the image installs and builds its own
node_modules
.next
.venv
coverage
out
build
*.tsbuildinfo

# test output
test-artifacts
test-results
playwright-report

# VCS, editor and agent state
.git
.github
.DS_Store
.agentspace
.claude
.gemini
.qwen
.dev-objects
